
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Jordi Bruin&#8217;s <a href="https://www.macwhisper.com">MacWhisper</a> shipped version 14, and it&#8217;s already up to 14.1. The big addition is a new Editor View. You can edit a transcript right in the main transcript screen now, add paragraphs more easily, reassign speakers faster, and favorite the parts you want to keep. Performance improved too.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Transcripts are more valuable than ever as we try to give our AI assistants more context. I use MacWhisper daily as a result.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Scam sites ending in .org have also been impersonating MacWhisper, and their download links install malware. Get MacWhisper only from <a href="https://www.macwhisper.com">macwhisper.com</a>, the <a href="https://goodsnooze.gumroad.com/l/macwhisper">official Gumroad page</a>, or the Mac App Store.</p>
